<h2 id="aweber-review">📧 AWeber: Best for Property Managers Who Want Simplicity and a Free Start</h2>

<StarRating rating={4.4} label="AWeber Overall" />

<h3>What AWeber Does</h3>

<p>AWeber has been a dependable email platform for over two decades. It is not the flashiest tool in 2026, but it is one of the most reliable — and for property managers who want a straightforward system they can hand off to an admin without training headaches, that reliability is worth a lot. AWeber's free plan supports up to 500 subscribers, which is a legitimate starting point for a smaller portfolio or a manager just building out their communication infrastructure.</p>

<p>We used AWeber on a 75-unit portfolio managed by a two-person team. Neither team member had prior email marketing experience. Both were fully independent in the platform within a week. That is the AWeber story: it gets out of your way.</p>

<h3>Key Features for Property Managers</h3>

<h4>Email Automations (Campaigns)</h4>
<p>AWeber's automation builder — called Campaigns — supports trigger-based sequences with tagging logic. It is less visually sophisticated than Moosend's canvas but covers the core use cases: welcome sequences for new leads, scheduled drip campaigns for owner communications, and tag-triggered sequences for applicants moving through your pipeline. We have a deeper breakdown of how to structure these in our guide to <a href="https://realestateopshub.com/email-automation-for-landlords">email automation for landlords</a>.</p>

<h4>Broadcast and Newsletter Tools</h4>
<p>AWeber's newsletter and broadcast tools are polished. The drag-and-drop editor includes real estate-adjacent templates, and sending a monthly owner report or community newsletter takes under 20 minutes from blank canvas to sent. For operators who run regular owner communications, this is a genuine time saver.</p>

<h4>Deliverability Track Record</h4>
<p>AWeber's deliverability reputation is one of the strongest in the industry, built over decades of compliance enforcement. If you are sending legally sensitive communications — late payment reminders, lease violation notices, or anything touching Fair Housing compliance — inbox reliability matters enormously. In our testing, AWeber matched Moosend's 97%+ inbox placement rate.</p>

<h4>Integrations</h4>
<p>AWeber integrates natively with Zapier, which connects it to virtually every property management platform on the market. We have successfully connected it to AppFolio, Buildium, and Rent Manager via Zapier workflows to sync tenant contact data automatically. See our overview of <a href="https://realestateopshub.com/property-management-software-integrations">property management software integrations</a> for setup guidance.</p>

