<h2 id="who-should-use-which">🏢 Which Platform Is Right for Your Portfolio?</h2>

<p>The choice between Moosend and AWeber comes down to two questions: how sophisticated is your automation strategy, and how large is your team?</p>

<p><strong>Choose Moosend if:</strong> You are managing 100+ doors and want to build a full lease lifecycle automation system. You want a landing page builder for vacancy marketing. You have at least one person on your team who will actively manage and optimize email sequences. The automation depth and landing page tool make Moosend the more powerful operator platform.</p>

<p><strong>Choose AWeber if:</strong> You are a smaller operator or just starting to build email infrastructure. You want a free entry point with room to grow. Your primary use case is reliable broadcast communications — monthly newsletters, owner reports, community updates — rather than complex automation. AWeber's simplicity and deliverability reputation make it the lower-friction choice for lean teams.</p>

